[00:00.00] 作曲 : Phil Elverum
[00:02.79] The foggy air around us was blinding
[00:07.17] The foggy sea was loud behind it
[00:11.50] Its foggy breath breathed its water into our lungs
[00:18.39] And we curled up around it
[00:21.68] And we were deafened by the sound of foggy waves' crash
[00:27.01] It's still ringing in my ears
[00:30.96] But my ears and lungs are nothing
[00:34.46] Compared to my eyes, I saw something
[00:38.20] In the sand that swept me off my feet
[00:43.70] Oh, the blow
[00:52.84]
[01:52.90] Oh it's pulling out in tide tows
[01:56.29] And rising back in misty wave throws
[02:00.29] Forever churning up its boiling strength
[02:07.08] And with the faster that the car flies
[02:10.71] Stick your head out of the window
[02:14.19] And find it beating hard and sweet into my face
[02:21.38] And in a moment when time slows
[02:25.27] The air gets so wide and thick
